 },
 {
  "text": "Hello, Dienane. This is Rafael, from the reception. There is a visitor here for you. Her name is Sandra, and she is from the bank. She is short and slim, and she has long curly hair. She wears glasses and a blue jacket. She is waiting near the door. Please come down when you can. Thank you!",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a21_listening_reception.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Hi, Dienane, it is Carla from the office. Our new intern starts on Monday. His name is Lucas. He is young, about twenty years old. He is very tall, and he has short black hair. He does not have a beard, but he wears glasses. He is friendly and a little quiet. Please say hello to him on Monday. Thanks!",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a21_listening_new_intern.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "First, Marcos asks, what does the new coworker look like? Then Dienane says, he is tall and slim. Next, she says, he has short curly hair and a beard. After that, she says, he wears glasses. Finally, Marcos finds him at the reception.",
